{"item_uid": "指考101-geography-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "自 1960 年代起，臺灣開始在不同的地區，選擇適合當地生長的作物或牲畜發展農業\n專業園區。臺灣農業專業園區的興起和發展，與該時期哪項現象的關係最密切？", "options": {"A": "勞力老化", "B": "地層下陷", "C": "土地退化", "D": "交通革新"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 85.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 4.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 94.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 10.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 74.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 85.0, "p_high": 94.0, "p_low": 74.0, "discrimination": 20.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 91.0, 87.0, 81.0, 70.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-geography-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "若全球氣候暖化加劇，則在不考慮其他的因素下，下列哪些地理界線的變化最有可能\n發生？（甲）高山的森林與草原界線海拔高度上移；（乙）高山雪線的海拔高度下降；\n（丙）葡萄、橄欖栽培北界向高緯度推移；（丁）稻、麥生長分界向低緯度推移。", "options": {"A": "甲乙", "B": "甲丙", "C": "乙丁", "D": "丙丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 84.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 97.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 15.0, "B": 63.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 84.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 63.0, "discrimination": 34.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 95.0, 91.0, 82.0, 52.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-geography-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "美國威斯康辛州中南部林地和草原有機質分布的調查顯示：「林地每英畝的有機質\n總量 386 噸，其中 202 噸貯存於林木中；草原每英畝的有機質總量 352 噸，其中只\n有 7 噸貯存於草體」。透過此一資料可獲得下列哪項推論？", "options": {"A": "森林的生態系統較草原脆弱", "B": "森林區的土壤層較草原深厚", "C": "森林的生物總量較草原繁多", "D": "森林區的開發歷史較草原早"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 18.0, "B": 41.0, "C": 37.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 29.0, "B": 34.0, "C": 34.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 46.0, "C": 40.0, "D": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 18.0, "p_high": 29.0, "p_low": 9.0, "discrimination": 20.0, "p_quintiles": [34.0, 22.0, 15.0, 11.0, 8.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-geography-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "圖一為某地的港口形勢圖。港口開築後，圖中甲乙丙丁四處，何\n處最可能因海岸侵蝕加劇，而需要堆放消波塊以防止海岸後退？", "options": {"A": "甲", "B": "乙", "C": "丙", "D": "丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 27.0, "C": 62.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 84.0, "D": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 7.0, "B": 41.0, "C": 41.0, "D": 11.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 62.0, "p_high": 84.0, "p_low": 41.0, "discrimination": 43.0, "p_quintiles": [88.0, 76.0, 62.0, 49.0, 37.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-geography-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "臺灣國家公園的選定，主要參考下列哪幾項條件？\n（甲）具有特殊景觀，或重要生態系統、生物多樣性棲地者；\n（乙）具有重要之文化資產及史蹟，其自然及人文環境富有文\n化教育意義者；\n（丙）具有地廣人稀之低度開發，保有相對完整之地理環境者；\n圖一\n（丁）具有天然育樂資源，風貌特異者。", "options": {"A": "甲乙丙", "B": "甲乙丁", "C": "甲丙丁", "D": "乙丙丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 51.0, "B": 39.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 50.0, "B": 46.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 50.0, "B": 32.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 2.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 39.0, "p_high": 46.0, "p_low": 32.0, "discrimination": 14.0, "p_quintiles": [49.0, 41.0, 38.0, 35.0, 31.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-geography-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "非洲東部在 30 年來，至少每十年會出現一次飢荒，最近一次是 2011 年，受災人數高\n達 1240 萬，其中以衣索比亞、吉布地、肯亞和索馬利亞等國問題最為嚴重。除了人\n為因素外，非洲東部飢荒頻率高的現象，和該地哪項氣候特色關係密切？", "options": {"A": "乾濕季節分明", "B": "終年高溫炎熱", "C": "雨量變率較大", "D": "日照時數較少"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 18.0, "B": 32.0, "C": 50.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 18.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 70.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 15.0, "B": 55.0, "C": 30.0, "D": 1.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 50.0, "p_high": 70.0, "p_low": 30.0, "discrimination": 40.0, "p_quintiles": [76.0, 59.0, 50.0, 39.0, 25.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-geography-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "照片一為臺灣某地的天主堂。該教堂的整體建築\n風格，最能顯示臺灣的何種人文特色？", "options": {"A": "文化呈多元色彩", "B": "原住民族社眾多", "C": "老年人口比率高", "D": "區域發展不均衡"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 99.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 100.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 97.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 1.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 99.0, "p_high": 100.0, "p_low": 97.0, "discrimination": 3.0, "p_quintiles": [100.0, 100.0, 100.0, 99.0, 96.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
