{"item_uid": "指考101-geography-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "「都市人口中，中等收入之比例逐年增加」的預測，可推論中國未來的都市發展會\n有可能出現下列哪種變化？", "options": {"A": "城鄉關係緊密", "B": "貧富差距縮小", "C": "都市規模擴大", "D": "都市階層複雜"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "8-9", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 61.0, "C": 31.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 73.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 2.0, "B": 49.0, "C": 39.0, "D": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 61.0, "p_high": 73.0, "p_low": 49.0, "discrimination": 24.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 66.0, 60.0, 54.0, 46.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-geography-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "該圖最可能是下列哪個節氣前後某日的天\n氣圖？", "options": {"A": "驚蟄（國曆3月6日左右）", "B": "立夏（國曆5月6日左右）", "C": "立秋（國曆8月8日左右）", "D": "寒露（國曆10月8日左右） 圖二"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "10-11", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 26.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 59.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 39.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 57.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 13.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 54.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 26.0, "p_high": 39.0, "p_low": 13.0, "discrimination": 26.0, "p_quintiles": [44.0, 31.0, 24.0, 17.0, 11.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-geography-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "根據該天氣圖所提供的資訊，下列哪些最可能是該日氣象報告的內容？\n（甲）臺灣受西南氣流影響，各地午後會有雷陣雨\n（乙）冷鋒正往臺灣接近，未來數日天氣逐漸轉冷\n（丙）臺灣各地早晚氣溫偏低，沿海低地慎防寒害\n（丁）臺灣海峽東北季風強勁，海面船隻多加注意", "options": {"A": "甲乙", "B": "甲丁", "C": "乙丙", "D": "丙丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "10-11", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 34.0, "D": 54.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 78.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 45.0, "D": 29.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 54.0, "p_high": 78.0, "p_low": 29.0, "discrimination": 49.0, "p_quintiles": [83.0, 69.0, 55.0, 42.0, 22.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-geography-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "該種地形景觀的塑造，和下列哪種地形作用的關係\n最密切？", "options": {"A": "堆積作用", "B": "風化作用", "C": "崩壞作用", "D": "岩溶作用"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "12-13", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 25.0, "B": 50.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 16.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 30.0, "B": 58.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 19.0, "B": 44.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 25.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 50.0, "p_high": 58.0, "p_low": 44.0, "discrimination": 14.0, "p_quintiles": [62.0, 52.0, 49.0, 48.0, 41.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-geography-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "該種地形景觀在下列哪些環境中最容易出現？\n（甲）位居信風帶背風側；（乙）沿海有寒、暖流\n交會；（丙）曾遭大陸冰河長期覆蓋；（丁）終年\n受副熱帶高壓籠罩；（戊）深居內陸，周圍又有高 照片二\n山屏障；（己）夏熱冬暖、年溫差不大，夏乾冬雨。", "options": {"A": "甲乙丁", "B": "甲丁戊", "C": "乙丙己", "D": "丙戊己"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "12-13", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 15.0, "B": 46.0, "C": 22.0, "D": 17.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 5.0, "B": 66.0, "C": 16.0, "D": 14.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 27.0, "B": 29.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 16.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 46.0, "p_high": 66.0, "p_low": 29.0, "discrimination": 37.0, "p_quintiles": [72.0, 54.0, 43.0, 35.0, 26.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
