{"item_uid": "指考101-geography-023", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 23, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列哪些事實，最足以解釋「中南美洲殖民式經濟色彩濃厚」？\n（甲）大部分國家平均國民所得屬中高或中低所得國家。\n（乙）低緯地區熱帶栽培業發達，中緯地帶畜牧業鼎盛。\n（丙）都市化程度雖高，但首要型的都市體系型態普遍。\n（丁）從1980至2010年，平均HDI由0.573增加為0.704。\n（戊）輸出以農牧礦產品為主，輸入以工業產品為大宗。", "options": {"A": "甲乙丙", "B": "甲乙丁", "C": "乙丙戊", "D": "丙丁戊"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "21-23", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 84.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 97.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 12.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 67.0, "D": 11.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 84.0, "p_high": 97.0, "p_low": 67.0, "discrimination": 30.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 95.0, 90.0, 81.0, 58.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
