{"item_uid": "指考101-geography-030", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 30, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "2012 年 4 月，總統曾訪問我國在非洲的 4 個友邦，但\n℃ 丙 mm ℃ 丁 mm\n赤道附近的聖多美普林西比，因該國元首另有行程，\n以致總統未能造訪該國。該國位於哪個氣候圖代表的\n氣候區內？", "options": {"A": "甲", "B": "乙", "C": "丙", "D": "丁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "30-32", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 86.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 95.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 71.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 18.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 86.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 71.0, "discrimination": 24.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 94.0, 91.0, 85.0, 63.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
